cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RockMassPy in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "RockMassPy: rock mass classifications, Hoek-Brown strength and mining geomechanics"
abstract: >-
  Open-source rock mass engineering library for mining: rock mass classifications (RQD, RMR, Q, GSI, MRMR, Q-slope,
  SMR), Hoek-Brown strength, site-customizable classification tables, charts, ground support recommendation,
  per-country regulatory profiles, open-pit slope analysis and data-driven support prediction. C++20 core with a
  Python API. Every result records the method edition it follows.
authors:
  - family-names: "Quintanilla Ventura"
    given-names: "Miqueas"
    email: "miqueasq@gmail.com"
version: "0.1.1"
date-released: "2026-11-07"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Miqueas7/RockMassPy"
url: "https://miqueas.dev/rockmasspy"
keywords:
  - mining
  - geomechanics
  - rock mass
  - RMR
  - Q-system
  - GSI
  - Hoek-Brown
  - slope stability
